    "text": "I, John Anthony Emmanuel Amarathunga, Minister of Lands, herebydeclare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land AcquisitionAct, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose andwill be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
